2. Core content: (1) Mother's smile as she kneaded the dough; (2) details of Grandma's stall at the alley entrance (coal briquette stove, three children, 0.5 yuan shredded radish pancakes);
3. Completion status: a roughly 500-word essay, published to a personal writing WeChat official account.

