2. Li Na suggested paying in installments.
II. Personal review:
1. Re-examine Liu Tao's reference images;
2. Figure out which parts of the project to do yourself (lighting, some display stands) and which to outsource (bar counter, stainless steel wall racks), and find a compromise.
